DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aatt__qquuiicckk__eexxiitt() function registers a cleanup function to be called
     when the program exits as a result of calling quick_exit(3).  The cleanup
     functions are called in the reverse order and will not be called if the
     program exits by calling exit(3), _Exit(3), or abort(3).

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The aatt__qquuiicckk__eexxiitt() function returns the value 0 if successful and a non-
     zero value on failure.

